HST Office: Writer's Styles gallery keeps 6, 4, then 3 previews in its row before it becomes "Kiểu ▾".

Gap list G05 (owner decision 14/11/2026): the gallery narrowed to one preview as soon as the Home tab shrank, so
at 1366 px it showed a single three-line tile. It now answers the ribbon ladder's "hst-gallery-state" (as Slides'
theme gallery does, hst-ribbon-ux-gallery-fit.patch): 6 previews at the large group, 4 at medium, 3 at small; the
next step is the group's "Kiểu ▾" button. The view still takes any extra room the ribbon leaves.

